# #237 Vampiric Pounce and #144 special cues: the caught bite heals Dreadlord up to 4 percent; every special form shows its Warcraft spell.
# Dreadlord a against Dreadlord b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero dreadlord
# #144: Bat Ascension, paid.
40 a stick 0 1
40 a tap X 2
41 a stick 0 0
42 a capture
49 a capture
# b walks in and lands a jab on a.
70 b press LB
70 b stick -1 0
126 b stick 0 0
127 b release LB
135 b tap A 2
# a walks in with forward tilts before Sleep and Vampiric Pounce.
170 a press LB
170 a stick 1 0
180 a tap A 2
190 a capture
220 a tap A 2
230 a capture
260 a tap A 2
270 a stick 0 0
271 a release LB
# #144: Sleep on the close b, then Vampiric Pounce on the sleeper.
300 a stick 0 -1
300 a tap X 2
301 a stick 0 0
302 a capture
326 a capture
360 a stick 1 0
360 a tap X 2
361 a stick 0 0
362 a capture
364 a capture
# Earn mana: two more forward tilts.
420 a press LB
420 a stick 1 0
430 a tap A 2
440 a capture
470 a tap A 2
480 a stick 0 0
481 a release LB
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# #237: another press keeps the forward corkscrew and its trailing bats.
600 a stick 1 0
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
602 a capture
604 a capture
605 a stick 1 0
605 a tap X 2
606 a stick 0 0
607 a capture
# #251: recover mana after the two paid Pounces; preserve every cast form.
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
1500 a press VIEW
1570 a release VIEW
2000 a press VIEW
2070 a release VIEW
# #144: Carrion Swarm, then from the air; Sleep from the air; Pounce from the air, back toward the middle.
2140 a tap X 2
2140 a capture
2142 a capture
2190 a tap B 8
2200 a tap X 2
2202 a capture
2220 a capture
2250 a tap B 8
2260 a stick 0 -1
2260 a tap X 2
2261 a stick 0 0
2262 a capture
2286 a capture
2320 a tap B 8
2330 a stick -1 0
2330 a tap X 2
2331 a stick 0 0
2332 a capture
2347 a capture
# #144: Bat Ascension, free.
2410 a stick 0 1
2410 a tap X 2
2411 a stick 0 0
